    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s01-t03-drill-08-question",
      "type": "question",
      "title": "实战精刷 · 第8题",
      "question": {
        "id": "quantity-wy27-s01-t03-drill-08",
        "type": "single",
        "stem": "（26联考）人形机器人企业有甲、乙、丙3个研发团队。甲的人数是乙的2/3，乙的人数是丙的4/5。甲团队招聘5人、丙团队招聘若干人后，3个团队的人数比为3∶4∶6。问3个研发团队原来共有多少人？",
        "options": [
          {
            "value": "A",
            "label": "165"
          },
          {
            "value": "B",
            "label": "175"
          },
          {
            "value": "C",
            "label": "185"
          },
          {
            "value": "D",
            "label": "210"
          }
        ],
        "answer": "B",
        "sourceAnswer": "B"
      },
      "source": {
        "type": "pdf",
        "documentId": "quantity-wy27",
        "title": "王炎·27数量关系大满贯·讲义",
        "pages": [
          16
        ],
        "printedPages": [
          10
        ],
        "originalImages": [
          {
            "src": "assets/images/courses/quantity-wy27/quantity-wy27-s01-t03-drill-08-p016.webp",
            "alt": "和差倍比问题（一） · 实战精刷8 · 讲义第10页",
            "pdfPage": 16
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s01-t03-drill-08-explanation-01",
      "type": "text",
      "role": "explanation",
      "title": "我们这样分析",
      "questionId": "quantity-wy27-s01-t03-drill-08",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "讲义参考答案：B"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "我们先统一原来人数比：甲∶乙=2∶3、乙∶丙=4∶5，合并为8∶12∶15。乙没有招聘，12份人数始终不变。新比3∶4∶6把乙的4份扩大3倍，成为9∶12∶18。"
        },
        {
          "type": "formula",
          "latex": "甲增加1份=5\\text{人},\\qquad原总数=(8+12+15)\\times5=175"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "核验原为40、60、75人，招聘后45、60、90人，正好3∶4∶6，丙招聘15人。所以选B。"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "这道题记住什么"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "比例变化先找不变量，用不变量统一前后份数。"
        }
      ],
